<DocsLayout title="About">
    <h1>About Bravo</h1>
    <h2>Why Bravo?</h2>
    <p>Bravo is an agentic design system starter package to guide you through the process of defining your own agentic design system and document it for your team.</p>
    <p>When started working with Design Systems I always desired to have a system that would guide me through the process of defining my own design system and document it for my team. 
        Starting from scratch was a daunting task, so I decided to create a starter package that could help me and others to start their own design system journey.</p>

    <h2>Credits</h2>
    <p>Bravo was built by Jose Carlos Martinez, a product designer and design systems enthusiast based in Malaga, Spain.</p>
    <p>You can find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jcmartinezma/">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://github.com/jcmartinezma">GitHub</a>.</p>
